  "note": "The five possessed Channelers of the Route 1 mansion, one per escort room. Each is a Radical Cobblemon Trainer (tools/route_trainers.py generates its RCT data beside the route trainers', and tools/reapply.py R17 places it at its seat) who battles on sight and is beaten once per player. Her sight_distance is the largest that reaches no standable cell outside her room on either floor, less 0.75: rctmod's battle on sight passes through walls (the owner, in game, 2026-09-24: Paula started a fight from the foyer). Beating one sets that player's guard field, and the room's puzzle stays shut until it is set: the transition it gates checks the field, and the room's props and Pip open on a guarded line. Movesets are level-up moves each species has at or below its level in Cobblemon 1.8.0's species data (read from the jar, 2026-09-24).",
